{
  "key": 14821,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Thank you for your help\n",
        "at the Lighthouse...\r",
        "But this is different. Please allow me to\n",
        "introduce myself.\r",
        "I am Jasmine, a Gym Leader.\n",
        "I use the...clang!\f",
        "Steel type!\r",
        "...Do you know about the Steel type?\r",
        "They are very hard, cold, sharp,\n",
        "and really strong!\f",
        "Um... I’m not lying.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: ...You are a better Trainer\n",
        "than me, in both skill and kindness.\r",
        "In accordance with League rules,\n",
        "I confer upon you this Badge.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Mineral Badge from Jasmine!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: With that Badge,\n",
        "all Pokémon, including traded\f",
        "Pokémon up to Lv. 70, will obey\f",
        "you without question.\f",
        "Um... Please take this, too...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00004",
      "garbage": 27
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: It is called Iron Tail...\r",
        "Your Pokémon will hit the target\n",
        "with its hard tail, occasionally\f",
        "lowering the target’s Defense..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Um...\r",
        "I don’t know how to say this, but\n",
        "good luck..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Long time, no see.\r",
        "Um... I’m fine, thank you.\r",
        "I don’t know how to say this,\n",
        "but...nothing..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Um... Er...\r",
        "Will you trade your Pokémon\n",
        "for mine? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Really? Thank you very much!\r",
        "I’ll be happy with any Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Oh, uh-huh, I see.\n",
        "That’s disappointing, but I understand."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Thank you so much.\n",
        "I’ll take good care of it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: Don’t you sometimes feel like\n",
        "scrubbing Steel-type Pokémon?\f",
        "Don’t you?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00013",
      "en_US": "Will you trade {STRVAR_1 1, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: I like Eggs, too, but\n",
        "I’d like a Pokémon, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\f",
        "One that might have a little training..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine: I’d appreciate it so much...\n",
        "Except that I cannot accept such\f",
        "a precious Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine, the Gym Leader?\n",
        "She’s at the Lighthouse.\r",
        "She’s been tending to a sick Pokémon.\r",
        "A strong Trainer is compassionate\n",
        "at the same time..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Jasmine uses Steel-type Pokémon.\r",
        "She’s trying to hide her tenderness\n",
        "behind her steely coldness."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "That was awesome.\f",
        "The Steel type, huh?\f",
        "That was one heated battle you had!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "I knew you’d come here.\r",
        "Thank you for helping the Gym Leader,\n",
        "but battle is a separate matter.\r",
        "Go for it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Impressive!\r",
        "You should continue your journey to\n",
        "different places.\r",
        "Since you can use Surf, why don’t you\n",
        "try it on the Lake of Rage?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Giggle...\r",
        "I know how capable you are\n",
        "from the Lighthouse.\r",
        "It’s time you showed that side of\n",
        "yourself to Jasmine! Good luck!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00022",
      "en_US": [
        "You are amazing...\r",
        "You should aim even higher, since\n",
        "you have such potential.\r",
        "Have you been to Mahogany Town?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00023",
      "en_US": "Olivine City Pokémon Gym"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0606_T26GYM0101_00024",
      "en_US": [
        "Olivine City Pokémon Gym\r",
        "Leader: Jasmine\n",
        "Certified Trainer!\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
